r-assets.mp4","poster","/GameMap/media/showcase/recording-triposr-assets.webp","aspectRatio",1.509433962264151,"mobile","previewSrc","Preview description","The complete official TripoSR comparison, with five input images above their rotating reconstructed 3D objects.","alt","Recording type","Original project recording","role","provenance","Track","3D","track","metadata","Related project",[92],"resourceId",{"_49":93,"_26":94},"TripoSR","/resources/triposr/","What this recording shows","An author-produced single-image reconstruction teaser, not a playable scene. Its animation timing does not measure inference latency. Reconstruction was not run locally, and game-ready topology, rigging and runtime performance were not tested.","limitations","Demo category","Asset generation","demoType","lead","source-recording","assets","3d","recordingId","triposr","resource:triposr","resource","Quickly reconstructs a 3D object from one image for asset prototyping.","/resources/",{"_20":106,"_170":93,"_168":104,"_47":171,"_169":109,"_163":162,"_26":63,"_153":172,"_149":173,"_146":174,"_140":175,"_137":136},[114,115,116,117,118,119,120,121,122,123,124,125,126],"website/src/data/resources.json",{"_47":22,"_51":93,"_53":170,"_55":-7},{"_47":101,"_51":109,"_53":169,"_55":-7},{"_47":48,"_49":166,"_51":167,"_53":168,"_55":88},{"_47":48,"_49":164,"_51":165,"_53":47,"_55":88},{"_47":48,"_49":161,"_51":162,"_53":163,"_55":56},{"_47":57,"_49":158,"_59":159,"_53":26,"_55":-7},{"_47":141,"_49":151,"_143":144,"_59":152,"_53":153,"_55":-7},{"_47":141,"_49":147,"_143":144,"_59":148,"_53":149,"_55":-7},{"_47":141,"_49":142,"_143":144,"_59":145,"_53":146,"_55":-7},{"_47":48,"_49":138,"_51":139,"_53":140,"_55":88},{"_47":48,"_49":135,"_51":136,"_53":137,"_55":88},{"_47":48,"_53":132,"_49":133,"_51":134},{"_47":57,"_53":127,"_49":128,"_59":129},"identitySource","Identity evidence",[130],{"_49":131,"_26":63},"Tripo AI · VAST","identity","Identity & attribution","The official README explicitly says TripoSR was collaboratively developed by Tripo AI and Stability AI. The VAST-AI-Research organization links to tripo3d.ai. This shows Tripo/VAST as one verified co-developer, not as the sole author.","Source reviewed","2026-10-18","verified","Year","2024","year","list","Tracks","ordered",false,[86],"dimensions","Development stages",[150],"stages","Assets & animation","Topics",[154,155,156,157],"tags","Image-to-3D","Reconstruction","Mesh","Prototype assets","Project source",[160],{"_49":158,"_26":63},"Why it belongs here","Uses LRM-style feed-forward reconstruction, with public code, pretrained models, and a demo. An input image becomes an exportable object mesh. It focuses on individual objects; hidden surfaces, topology, and game performance need additional work. It is not a complete scene or playable game generator.","detail","Resource type","Tool","Category","3D development","category","summary","name","tool",[154,155,156,157],[103],[104],2024,{"_177":178},"documents",{"_179":180,"_181":182},"en",[184,188,189,190,187,191,192,193,194,195,196,197,198,199,200,201,202,203,204,205,206,207,208,209,210,211,212,213,214,215,216,217,218,219,220,221,222,186,223,185,224,225,226,227,228,229,230,231,232,233,234,235,236,237,238,239,240,241,242,243,244],"zh",[183,184,185,186,187],"reading-guide","practical-guide","level-design-skill","deployment","publishing-platforms","tutorials-and-demos","coding-agent-game-code","game-testing-library","agents-notes","engines-notes","game-ai-notes","cadle-repositories","world-model-notes","research-index","production-research-notes","engine-operation-contracts","production-work-orders","studio-production-case-studies","native-operation-details","production-debugging-contracts","production-coverage-gaps","generative-tools-research","generative-api-boundaries","generation-delivery-contracts","asset-validation-contracts","asset-selection-feedback","visual-evidence-research","visual-feedback-mechanisms","game-development-evaluation","benchmark-reproduci